# Always update GitHub

After finishing work that belongs in the repo or on GitHub Pages:

1. Commit the relevant files.
2. Run `git push origin HEAD` (this repo uses `main`).

Do this without waiting to be asked. Do not force-push. Do not skip hooks.

Never commit `.env`, secrets, `.coverage`, or overwrite `data/projects.csv`.
If commit or push fails, report the error and stop.
